WEBVTT


00:00:13.306 --> 00:00:16.142
If you'll indulge for a moment
my rhyming motif,


00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:19.271
I'd like to tell you a tale
of a place called the Reef.


00:00:20.481 --> 00:00:24.819
The entire coral kingdom is
a delight to the senses...


00:00:24.985 --> 00:00:29.031
Alas, that is not where
our story commences.


00:00:30.366 --> 00:00:34.454
We're used to blue water,
this water would spook us,


00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:40.460
It's the color of phlegm,
or possibly mucus.


00:00:41.003 --> 00:00:42.630
And the salty sea spray
that wafts on the breeze,


00:00:42.796 --> 00:00:46.050
Is like the stuff that comes out
of your nose when you sneeze.


00:00:46.175 --> 00:00:49.470
In this polluted and ominous swill,


00:00:49.595 --> 00:00:55.936
There was one little fish
of unusual skill...


00:00:56.061 --> 00:00:58.021
Who would one day meet
a most incredible fate,


00:00:58.188 --> 00:01:04.653
Full of fighting! Romancing!
Becoming live bait!


00:01:04.779 --> 00:01:09.033
I know it boggles the mind
and beggars belief,


00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.829
But that's the wee lad
who'd one day save the Reef.


00:01:14.497 --> 00:01:18.460
<i>Shark Bait</i>


00:01:25.593 --> 00:01:29.055
I don't have anything against
your cousin Pearl... except she's nuts.


00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.057
But that doesn't mean
I wanna live next door to her.


00:01:31.182 --> 00:01:33.226
But Pike, it's safe on the Reef.


00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:34.936
There's no fishing,
the water's clean...


00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:37.230
But honey, I love Boston.


00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.524
What's the big attraction?
Is it the gill nets?


00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:42.069
The medical waste?
The industrial pollution?


00:01:42.194 --> 00:01:44.738
- Hey, it's never hurt me.
- Oh please, Pike.


00:01:44.905 --> 00:01:46.532
Sweetie, you're so full of mercury


00:01:46.699 --> 00:01:48.868
I could stick your tail in my mouth
and take my temperature.


00:01:48.993 --> 00:01:53.748
Honey, you're exaggerating.
The water here is perfectly healthy.


00:01:53.915 --> 00:01:56.251
- Hey, Pike.
- Morning, Bob.


00:01:57.794 --> 00:01:58.253
Honey.


00:01:58.420 --> 00:01:59.838
And what if Pi grows up
to have three eyes?


00:01:59.963 --> 00:02:01.131
Cool!


00:02:02.257 --> 00:02:05.636
Okay, but think of the cultural
opportunities here.


00:02:05.761 --> 00:02:08.556
In Boston Harbor, Pi can meet
fish from all over the world!


00:02:08.681 --> 00:02:12.727
Oh like those salmon?
What a classy bunch they were.


00:02:12.894 --> 00:02:14.646
All of them talking
about how they just


00:02:14.771 --> 00:02:18.442
couldn't wait to
get up river and... S-P-A-W-N.


00:02:18.608 --> 00:02:20.068
Spawn!


00:02:21.987 --> 00:02:24.365
What did I tell you about
using language like that?


00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:25.449
I'm sorry!


00:02:25.616 --> 00:02:28.244
Oh, you're growing up so fast...


00:02:28.411 --> 00:02:31.289
Go play, sweetheart.
Your father and I need to talk.


00:02:31.414 --> 00:02:31.956
Okay!


00:02:32.123 --> 00:02:34.542
- But don't go too far!
- Pike!


00:02:41.675 --> 00:02:44.428
- Hey!
- Oh! Hallo!


00:02:44.595 --> 00:02:46.138
Haven't seen you around here before.


00:02:46.305 --> 00:02:49.058
I'm just passing through.
We're migrating.


00:02:49.183 --> 00:02:51.269
You're lucky. I wish I migrated.


00:02:51.394 --> 00:02:55.565
We never go anywhere.
You're a dolphin, right?


00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.568
I'm a porpoise! Why does
everyone think I'm a dolphin?


00:02:58.694 --> 00:03:00.153
Percy, darling,
we've getting ready to leave...


00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.656
Oh! Hallo, Mum.
This is... uh...


00:03:02.823 --> 00:03:04.283
Pi! Where are you?


00:03:04.408 --> 00:03:07.453
Oh, that's my mom,
I gotta go.


00:03:07.578 --> 00:03:09.455
Nice meeting you!


00:03:10.164 --> 00:03:12.750
Mom! Dad!
I met a porpoise!


00:03:12.876 --> 00:03:15.629
Pi! What did I tell you
about talking to strangers?


00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:19.675
You have to be careful, son.


00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.635
Boy, I'll say!


00:03:21.802 --> 00:03:23.762
You wouldn't believe some
of the weirdoes you see around here.


00:03:23.888 --> 00:03:26.349
Bob... Don't help me.


00:03:27.516 --> 00:03:30.645
- Hey! Watch it! what's the rush?
- It's a net!


00:03:30.812 --> 00:03:32.355
- Net?
- Swim!


00:03:32.522 --> 00:03:33.857
What are we gotta do?


00:03:36.109 --> 00:03:38.570
- Pike! Swim!
- Swim as fast as you can!


00:03:38.695 --> 00:03:41.323
- What is it?
- Swim, Pi!


00:03:43.993 --> 00:03:45.161
Swim!


00:03:51.834 --> 00:03:53.753
Pike! We've got to get him
out of here before they...


00:03:53.878 --> 00:03:55.881
They're pulling it up!


00:03:57.758 --> 00:04:00.302
Pi! Try to squeeze through!


00:04:00.469 --> 00:04:02.221
But... What about you?


00:04:02.346 --> 00:04:04.014
We're right behind you. Hurry!


00:04:05.182 --> 00:04:08.603
Push Pi!
Push harder!


00:04:09.562 --> 00:04:11.522
I made it! Come on!


00:04:11.689 --> 00:04:13.316
Mom! Dad!


00:04:14.734 --> 00:04:18.113
- Don't let him get near the net!
- Let go of me! I have to help 'em!


00:04:18.238 --> 00:04:21.200
Pi! Go to the Reef!
Find your Aunt Pearl!


00:04:21.366 --> 00:04:22.618
Promise me, Pi!


00:04:22.743 --> 00:04:24.995
I can't! You have to go with me!


00:04:25.162 --> 00:04:27.832
Promise me, Pi!
Promise me you'll go to the Reef!


00:04:27.957 --> 00:04:30.501
Mom! Dad!


00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.018
Mom... Dad...


00:04:48.437 --> 00:04:52.525
- We'll take you to the Reef,
- Pi. But I can't leave.


00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.904
What if they, what if they come back
and I'm not here?


00:04:57.072 --> 00:05:00.617
- They won't be able to find me.
- I'm sorry, Pi.


00:05:00.742 --> 00:05:04.705
But once the net gets you...
there's no coming back.


00:05:04.872 --> 00:05:08.251
Mom... Dad...


00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:34.821
Come on, Pi!


00:05:41.286 --> 00:05:42.413
Your turn!


00:06:04.478 --> 00:06:07.607
- Hey, what's in here?
- Let's find out!


00:06:11.277 --> 00:06:13.154
Hey, you kids!


00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.124
Pi, you can do it!


00:06:26.168 --> 00:06:28.504
- Cool!
- Hey, hello there?


00:06:28.671 --> 00:06:31.299
- Really big!
- Huge!


00:06:32.967 --> 00:06:36.429
Wow, wonderful.


00:06:50.695 --> 00:06:54.532
Hey! Wait! Wait!


00:07:06.963 --> 00:07:10.007
You all right?
Try again!


00:07:13.178 --> 00:07:16.848
Look at me!


00:07:19.184 --> 00:07:20.727
Wow!


00:07:45.254 --> 00:07:49.217
Hahaha, little fish...
It's not painful while I eat you,


00:07:49.383 --> 00:07:51.552
I'm gonna swallow you whole.


00:07:54.597 --> 00:07:55.724
Hey!


00:07:56.975 --> 00:07:59.061
What the... Bad fish!


00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:10.114
Pi! That was brilliant!


00:08:10.281 --> 00:08:11.741
You sure you won't come with us?


00:08:11.866 --> 00:08:15.328
I wish I could, Perc,
but I promised my mom.


00:08:15.453 --> 00:08:17.456
There you go, dear.


00:08:17.581 --> 00:08:19.958
Just follow those stones,
and they'll take you right to the Reef.


00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:24.046
I'll never forget you help,
Mum. So long, Perc.


00:08:24.171 --> 00:08:26.132
S'long, mate.


00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:38.353
Wow!


00:08:45.861 --> 00:08:49.532
- Dokdo is whose land?
It's Korean.


00:09:02.671 --> 00:09:04.840
It was a 55-foot trawler,


00:09:05.007 --> 00:09:07.635
and they we're using a three-pronged
titanium steel hook on 45-pound,


00:09:07.802 --> 00:09:09.762
stress-tested monofilament.


00:09:09.887 --> 00:09:11.556
I must have played 'em
for three hours


00:09:11.681 --> 00:09:13.725
before the line finally snapped
and they got away.


00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:18.021
55-foot trawler. Right...
Oh, like I haven't heard that one before.


00:09:18.563 --> 00:09:21.150
I tell ya... That boat gets bigger
every time he tells the story


00:09:21.275 --> 00:09:22.818
Excuse me?


00:09:22.985 --> 00:09:25.529
What's a matter, boychik?
You lost?


00:09:25.696 --> 00:09:27.156
How's that?
What'd he say?


00:09:27.281 --> 00:09:29.951
He says he's lost!
You deaf marlin.


00:09:30.076 --> 00:09:31.536
Actually, I'm looking
for my Aunt Pearl.


00:09:31.703 --> 00:09:34.247
- You're lookin' for a squirrel?
- No, no, Pearl!


00:09:34.372 --> 00:09:36.875
He's looking for the crazy lady!


00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.754
Oh, ee. Come here.
She lives right down there, chico.


00:09:43.507 --> 00:09:44.675
Thank you.


00:09:57.189 --> 00:09:59.149
That is right, darling.
Work with me!


00:09:59.274 --> 00:10:00.943
Now take it to the edge.


00:10:02.403 --> 00:10:07.450
Yes! Take it to the edge...
take it right to the edge...


00:10:08.784 --> 00:10:11.162
YOU'RE RIGHT AT THE EDGE!
Bring it back!


00:10:11.287 --> 00:10:15.750
Oh, yes, yeah!
Magnifique!


00:10:15.917 --> 00:10:18.378
- Who is that?
- Who is that?


00:10:18.503 --> 00:10:21.340
That's Cordelia, dude.
Where've you been?


00:10:21.465 --> 00:10:22.716
I just got into town.


00:10:22.883 --> 00:10:25.928
Oh. Welcome to the Scab, dude.


00:10:26.095 --> 00:10:27.638
Perhaps you should
wear it up.


00:10:27.763 --> 00:10:32.936
Oh, Yes! Sleek, sophisticated.
Like Audrey Hepburn.


00:10:33.103 --> 00:10:35.647
Only better... with scales!


00:10:36.606 --> 00:10:40.152
- She's beautiful.
- Oh yeah. She's a model.


00:10:40.277 --> 00:10:42.571
She've been on the cover
of National Geographic.


00:10:42.696 --> 00:10:43.948
Twice!


00:10:44.114 --> 00:10:46.659
Don't look over here!


00:10:46.784 --> 00:10:48.953
Ignore me... Look at me!


00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:49.871
I've got to meet her.


00:10:49.996 --> 00:10:53.541
Whoa there, newbie. newbie.
Take my advice and worship from afar.


00:11:23.699 --> 00:11:25.075
Uh? What?


00:11:25.201 --> 00:11:26.661
No, no, no, no.


00:11:26.786 --> 00:11:29.831
You're ruined my shot!
Baffoon! Baffoon!


00:11:29.997 --> 00:11:32.125
Can we please keep the local
riffraff out of my shot?


00:11:32.292 --> 00:11:33.960
Is that too much to ask?


00:11:34.085 --> 00:11:36.546
Sorry, sorry.
I'm sorry.


00:11:37.005 --> 00:11:39.132
That's your good side.


00:11:39.675 --> 00:11:41.343
That is a wrap, people!


00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:46.057
I don't blame you, mon cheri.
You were sublime, as always


00:11:46.182 --> 00:11:48.434
- Thank you, Max.
- Belissima! Ciao!


00:11:50.019 --> 00:11:53.898
Hey, I'm sorry. I didn't mean
to mess things up back there.


00:11:54.482 --> 00:11:57.110
Don't worry about it.
They'll be back


00:11:57.277 --> 00:12:00.489
Oh, cool, cool.


00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.159
So I'm Pi.
I'm new in town.


00:12:04.243 --> 00:12:06.620
Really?
I couldn't tell.


00:12:07.246 --> 00:12:09.540
Yeah, I just swam
in from Boston.


00:12:09.665 --> 00:12:11.709
Boston?
That's a long way.


00:12:11.834 --> 00:12:15.297
Well, you know I'm pretty
strong for my size.


00:12:15.463 --> 00:12:16.214
Check these mussels?


00:12:16.381 --> 00:12:19.009
- Hey!
- Hands off the merchandise!


00:12:19.176 --> 00:12:21.637
Oww! Hey. Easy, man!


00:12:21.762 --> 00:12:24.723
Cute and funny.
What did you say your name was?


00:12:25.516 --> 00:12:26.517
I'm PI.


00:12:26.559 --> 00:12:30.521
Well, Pi from Boston,
welcome to the Reef.


00:12:32.357 --> 00:12:35.485
Dude. She actually
talked to you!


00:12:35.652 --> 00:12:40.407
That's fully the most awesome
thing I've ever... seen?


00:12:52.253 --> 00:12:54.130
Cordelia, look out!


00:12:54.255 --> 00:12:57.426
Dude, don't!
He's a shark!


00:12:59.219 --> 00:13:00.929
Ohhhh. Hello fellas.


00:13:02.181 --> 00:13:04.558
- Help me! Somebody help me!
- Here you go, Mr. Crab.


00:13:04.683 --> 00:13:06.727
Thank you so very much!


00:13:06.894 --> 00:13:09.188
I have been
wrong-side up all day


00:13:09.355 --> 00:13:12.734
and it has been
most uncomfortable, ohhhhh!


00:13:19.366 --> 00:13:23.329
- You taste like tuna!
- You are what you eat.


00:13:24.246 --> 00:13:27.124
You're disgusting, Troy!
Why can't you leave me alone?


00:13:27.249 --> 00:13:28.918
But you are alone,
sweet gills.


00:13:29.085 --> 00:13:32.714
No family, no one to protect you
from the dangers of the deep.


00:13:32.881 --> 00:13:34.841
The only danger in this part
of the deep is you.


00:13:34.966 --> 00:13:38.345
Well then. All the more reason
to get on my good side.


00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.014
You need someone
to look after you.


00:13:41.932 --> 00:13:45.394
I don't need a rude, egotistical bully
with a bad case of tuna breath!


00:13:45.561 --> 00:13:47.229
- Back off!
- Pi!


00:13:47.355 --> 00:13:49.732
- What did you say?
- You heard me. Leave her alone.


00:13:49.857 --> 00:13:52.110
What are you gonna
do about it, Chum?


00:13:52.277 --> 00:13:56.031
- I'm... gonna...
- You're gonna,


00:13:56.156 --> 00:14:00.327
Oh yeah, you're gonna take a little trip...
through my digestive system.


00:14:01.453 --> 00:14:04.748
Man, you're gettin' chunky!
It used to be easy to stuff you into this hole.


00:14:04.874 --> 00:14:08.461
We're gonna have to find
a bigger hole,
or a skinnier nerd!


00:14:08.586 --> 00:14:12.966
Yikes! No more beating up
bad weathers.


00:14:13.091 --> 00:14:14.801
I'm grossed out!


00:14:14.968 --> 00:14:16.511
Let's get outta here!


00:14:17.137 --> 00:14:20.724
- Nobody close into my hole! Nobody!
- I can pick my old dough.


00:14:21.767 --> 00:14:24.103
Forget about him, he doesn't
know what he's saying!


00:14:27.648 --> 00:14:31.861
Yeah... That tends to happen
when you get smacked in the head.


00:14:33.071 --> 00:14:33.947
Hey!


00:14:34.072 --> 00:14:35.532
You're a coward, Troy!


00:14:35.657 --> 00:14:38.660
You only come to the Reef because
we're small and easy to push around


00:14:38.785 --> 00:14:42.247
Why don't you try this act out there,
in the open sea, where there're fish as big as you?


00:14:42.373 --> 00:14:46.544
I've got a soft spot, Cordelia,
for fine looking fish like you.


00:14:46.669 --> 00:14:50.339
But don't push me too far.
I'm Troy.


00:14:53.051 --> 00:14:55.303
Who's the shark
who's more bite than bark?


00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:56.638
Troy!


00:14:56.763 --> 00:15:00.142
Who's faster than a beam of light?
Who's got the teeth that are pearly white?


00:15:00.267 --> 00:15:01.143
Troy!


00:15:01.268 --> 00:15:02.936
Who gets the applause
'cause he's got the jaws?


00:15:03.062 --> 00:15:06.941
Who can do what
he wants just because?


00:15:07.066 --> 00:15:08.150
Who ain't afraid of
no lobster claws?


00:15:08.276 --> 00:15:09.444
Troy!


00:15:09.569 --> 00:15:11.446
Hey, that's me.


00:15:11.571 --> 00:15:16.034
I'll be back when you're done
playing mommy to that little hunk of bait.


00:15:16.201 --> 00:15:17.327
Vamanos...


00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.712
- You got fully thrashed, dude.
- What?


00:15:26.879 --> 00:15:30.007
Axed. Hemo-ed. Smeared. creamed,


00:15:30.174 --> 00:15:34.637
obliterated, flattened,
murdered, wipe out!


00:15:34.763 --> 00:15:36.723
That wasn't the smartest
thing I've ever seen.


00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:39.059
He hit me when I wasn't looking!


00:15:39.184 --> 00:15:40.936
There's only one dangerous place
on the Reef.


00:15:41.061 --> 00:15:42.062
And that's between Troy
and whatever he wants.


00:15:42.187 --> 00:15:44.648
Go home and get that
taken care of yourself.


00:15:45.691 --> 00:15:48.152
- What... Cordelia!
- Troy is my problem,


00:15:48.694 --> 00:15:51.239
and I don't want anyone else
getting hurt on my account.


00:15:51.406 --> 00:15:52.866
But...


00:15:54.951 --> 00:15:58.914
- Busy first day, dude.
- Yeah.


00:15:59.665 --> 00:16:01.542
Listen, I've gotta find my aunt Pearl.


00:16:01.667 --> 00:16:04.712
She's supposed to be
this weird kind of New Age,


00:16:04.879 --> 00:16:08.633
fortune teller type sort of...
- koo, koo!


00:16:08.758 --> 00:16:10.635
You know, crazy,
Basically insane.


00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:15.056
- You don't happen to know her, do you?
- Yeah, dude. She's my mom.


00:16:18.894 --> 00:16:24.441
I see it... yes. Oh boy,
that doesn't look good.


00:16:24.608 --> 00:16:27.862
What do you see?
Will my dreams come true?


00:16:27.945 --> 00:16:30.615
- Well, that depends.
- On what?


00:16:30.782 --> 00:16:34.327
Do your dreams involve sitting on a sink
next to a bottle of dishwashing liquid?


00:16:34.452 --> 00:16:35.829
This can't be!


00:16:35.954 --> 00:16:40.042
My cousin's a loofah! She's exfoliated
some of the most prominent backsides around!


00:16:40.167 --> 00:16:42.461
But I get to
scrub pots?


00:16:42.586 --> 00:16:43.754
NO!


00:16:43.879 --> 00:16:46.841
Curse you,
star-crossed DESTINY!


00:16:46.966 --> 00:16:49.469
Sponges.
They're all so emotional.


00:16:49.594 --> 00:16:53.181
At least she's not stuck in this pinnacle
all day and you get all the pretty!


00:16:53.306 --> 00:16:55.058
Sorry, Madge.


00:16:56.393 --> 00:16:58.937
- Dude.
- Dylan!


00:16:59.104 --> 00:17:02.107
Ohh! Pi!
You made it!


00:17:02.274 --> 00:17:05.027
- You knew I was coming?
- Of course darling.


00:17:05.152 --> 00:17:07.530
While meditating, my astral form
achieved a transcendent communion


00:17:07.655 --> 00:17:09.949
with none other than
the Spirit of the Sea!


00:17:10.074 --> 00:17:15.747
And it revealed to me
a vision of your arrival!


00:17:15.872 --> 00:17:19.334
And a passing porpoise mentioned
you were in the neighborhood.


00:17:20.294 --> 00:17:21.628
Then... you know
what happened to my parents.


00:17:21.795 --> 00:17:24.840
Oh, Pi, I'm so sorry!


00:17:25.007 --> 00:17:27.468
But I think they're
in a better place now


00:17:27.593 --> 00:17:29.554
Yeah. In a sushi bar.


00:17:29.679 --> 00:17:32.557
- Can it stop, fish!
- Don't hurt me!


00:17:32.682 --> 00:17:35.226
The Reef is where
you'll find your destiny, honey


00:17:35.352 --> 00:17:37.229
Give me your fin,
I'll tell your fortune...


00:17:37.354 --> 00:17:38.981
Oh, fish...


00:17:42.067 --> 00:17:43.861
Boy, let's see chapter two.


00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.700
Hey, I can't wait to
see all these sentences!


00:17:49.784 --> 00:17:52.829
Here come the Pull
on dorsal fin probe.


00:17:53.997 --> 00:17:55.457
I don't really
believe in that stuff.


00:17:55.582 --> 00:18:00.045
The Reef is a place
where dreams come true.


00:18:00.212 --> 00:18:02.548
Unless you happen to
be a sponge.


00:18:04.216 --> 00:18:06.844
Now Pi, the Reef is paradise,


00:18:07.011 --> 00:18:09.430
and you can go
anywhere you want.


00:18:09.555 --> 00:18:12.350
But stay away from the old wreck.
It's haunted by dead pirates.


00:18:12.475 --> 00:18:13.435
Cool!


00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:14.644
And most important of all:


00:18:14.769 --> 00:18:18.023
we never, ever, ever
go to Flatbottom.


00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:21.360
- What's Flatbottom?
- It's a place we never go.


00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:27.366
Awe Mom. You're not going out
in public like that, are you?


00:18:27.491 --> 00:18:30.453
I like to have a little star quality.


00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:35.041
Plus, It gives me more height and
helps to de-emphasize my tail fin.


00:18:35.208 --> 00:18:36.543
Right?


00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:41.048
I'm gonna need some time freshen up first,
I got like five armpits over here.


00:18:46.887 --> 00:18:50.350
Is that Ricky Marlin?


00:18:50.475 --> 00:18:52.644
Is that Ricky Marlin?


00:18:52.769 --> 00:18:55.981
No, huh. But almost.


00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.902
Oh, hello, Dr. Tang!


00:19:04.907 --> 00:19:07.451
He's a very prominent sturgeon.


00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.163
You see why I always
try to look my best,


00:19:10.288 --> 00:19:12.457
you never know
who you might meet.


00:19:17.796 --> 00:19:20.048
- What do you think?
- What? No. Ha. No. No.


00:19:20.173 --> 00:19:22.843
It clashes with the beer can.


00:19:22.968 --> 00:19:24.637
I think it'd look
better over there.


00:19:24.803 --> 00:19:27.848
You've crushing
my creative instincts.


00:19:28.391 --> 00:19:30.852
Check out the bling-bling
on Miss Thing!


00:19:31.394 --> 00:19:33.563
Oh, hello you two.


00:19:33.688 --> 00:19:37.067
More like J-Lo jellyfish.
So crazy.


00:19:37.192 --> 00:19:39.069
- Hello
- Looking good


00:19:39.861 --> 00:19:43.073
Oh, you two are such flirts!


00:19:43.741 --> 00:19:46.369
Don't stop... Don't stop!


00:19:47.286 --> 00:19:49.080
Oh, clams!


00:19:49.288 --> 00:19:53.334
I'm late for my healing crystal seminar
at the monkfish monastery,


00:19:53.501 --> 00:19:56.796
So Dylan, I want you
to introduce Pi around. Okay?


00:19:56.963 --> 00:19:59.341
- Yeah. Sure.
- Thanks, Sweetie.


00:19:59.466 --> 00:20:03.012
- No PDPA. Remember?
- PDPA?


00:20:03.178 --> 00:20:06.307
Public Displays of
Parental Affection.


00:20:06.474 --> 00:20:07.808
Excuse me, sir...
I'm not proud.


00:20:11.646 --> 00:20:15.025
Dude, that was
totally feebish.


00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.151
You can't be that big a feeb
and expect to hang out with me.


00:20:16.276 --> 00:20:17.527
Well, how big a feeb
can I be?


00:20:17.652 --> 00:20:20.906
Well, you can't be more than 30% feeb,
and no more than 15% dork.


00:20:21.031 --> 00:20:23.200
Hey! What's that?


00:20:24.243 --> 00:20:27.413
- That's the old pirate ship.
- Cool. Come on!


00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.123
No way, dude, now way.
It's totally off-limits.


00:20:29.248 --> 00:20:31.209
That's wonderful!


00:20:31.334 --> 00:20:33.920
Dude, I'm... Man!
Don't you listen!


00:20:34.045 --> 00:20:35.714
You're not afraid of
ghosts, are you?


00:20:35.839 --> 00:20:38.258
No, I'm not afraid of anything!


00:20:38.341 --> 00:20:41.428
But Dude, there's a totally spooky
turtle that lives in there.


00:20:41.553 --> 00:20:43.806
A spooky... turtle?


00:20:43.973 --> 00:20:49.520
No. No. Yeah. No. But yeah...
But he's a wizard turtle!


00:20:49.687 --> 00:20:52.232
And he really doesn't
like visitors.


00:20:52.357 --> 00:20:58.113
Dude! Oh... fish.
Ok, can we please just go? Please!


00:20:59.781 --> 00:21:02.409
That's him, you see.
That's Nerissa.


00:21:15.465 --> 00:21:17.634
Can we please not do that again?


00:21:17.759 --> 00:21:21.013
So, dude, you think you're
gonna see that Cordelia?


00:21:21.221 --> 00:21:23.432
Ugh. Not if she sees me first.


00:21:23.557 --> 00:21:26.727
Don't be nugatory, bro.
I think she really liked you.


00:21:26.894 --> 00:21:29.313
She thinks I'm an idiot.


00:21:29.439 --> 00:21:31.024
True. Well, maybe she likes idiots.


00:21:31.149 --> 00:21:34.402
It's kinda like having a friend
and a pet at the same time.


00:21:34.569 --> 00:21:35.612
So how bad is the shark
problem around here?


00:21:35.779 --> 00:21:38.407
Well, reef's too shallow for most sharks.
But Troy comes around


00:21:38.573 --> 00:21:43.329
every full moon, weee, fun for me,
you know. Him and his buddies.


00:21:43.454 --> 00:21:44.580
Why?


00:21:44.663 --> 00:21:48.125
'cause he's got a thing for Cordelia,
dude! Don't you listen?


00:21:48.876 --> 00:21:52.547
His buddies just come mostly
to stuff my head into a lobster hole.


00:21:52.672 --> 00:21:54.632
Yeah, like nobody
ever thought of that before.


00:21:54.758 --> 00:21:56.551
- Oh oh...
- What is it?


00:21:56.676 --> 00:21:58.929
- Flatbottom.
- It's the open sea.


00:21:59.096 --> 00:22:01.390
Why is everyone
so afraid of this place?


00:22:01.557 --> 00:22:03.225
I'm NOT afraid..!


00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:05.728
But we're outside the Wildlife Sanctuary.


00:22:05.853 --> 00:22:08.314
You see. And, and, this is where
the humans come with their nets


00:22:08.439 --> 00:22:10.942
and their hooks
and their sharp things.


00:22:13.445 --> 00:22:14.612
The net!


00:22:24.498 --> 00:22:25.624
Bye bye.


00:22:28.878 --> 00:22:30.046
Dylan?


00:22:33.591 --> 00:22:36.303
Dylan! Dylan!


00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:03.123
What happened to you little fella?


00:23:04.667 --> 00:23:06.043
Are you all right?


00:23:07.003 --> 00:23:08.129
Cordelia!


00:23:09.839 --> 00:23:11.716
- Don't panic!
- What is it?


00:23:11.841 --> 00:23:13.510
Haven't you ever seen a lure?


00:23:13.676 --> 00:23:16.221
Of course you haven't.
There's no fishing on the Reef.


00:23:16.346 --> 00:23:18.181
This must have been carried here
by the current.


00:23:18.265 --> 00:23:20.058
- What'll I do?
- Don't worry.


00:23:20.183 --> 00:23:21.518
I think I know someone who can help.


00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:24.980
We need some help over here!


00:23:27.274 --> 00:23:30.027
Front and center, girlfriend.
We got an emergency.


00:23:30.194 --> 00:23:33.615
- Look!
- Oh, honey! That is so not you!


00:23:33.782 --> 00:23:37.452
I tell you, these kids today, with their
extreme sports and their piercings.


00:23:37.619 --> 00:23:39.579
Guys, it was an accident.


00:23:39.705 --> 00:23:43.834
- I thought it was a smelt in distress.
- You were supposed to, honey.


00:23:43.959 --> 00:23:48.130
Good likeness. Looks like a smelt
I knew back in San Francisco...


00:23:48.297 --> 00:23:49.382
Oh, what a weekend that was.


00:23:49.465 --> 00:23:52.260
Oh no, not this story again!


00:23:52.385 --> 00:23:54.429
- Can you take it out?
- Absolutely!


00:23:54.554 --> 00:23:56.223
But you're going to have to
help me big time.


00:23:56.389 --> 00:23:57.015
Me?


00:23:57.182 --> 00:24:00.435
Ok, you lay back like
I'm giving you nice pedicure.


00:24:00.561 --> 00:24:03.981
Now what I need you to do is
to take her fin... that's right.


00:24:04.064 --> 00:24:08.444
And Honey, I want you to
look into his eyes, okay?


00:24:09.570 --> 00:24:14.701
Ok, now this isn't going to hurt... me.
You gonna be a brave girl?


00:24:14.868 --> 00:24:18.038
- I will.
- She will.


00:24:18.163 --> 00:24:20.541
She was!


00:24:21.875 --> 00:24:23.627
- How do you feel?
- Okay, I think.


00:24:23.752 --> 00:24:27.381
I guess I was more
scared than hurt.


00:24:27.465 --> 00:24:30.843
But I don't know what I would've done
if you hadn't been there, Pi.


00:24:32.262 --> 00:24:35.265
- How'd you wind up down here?
- I made a promise...


00:24:36.641 --> 00:24:39.227
Or maybe it's destiny.


00:24:39.394 --> 00:24:43.148
Well... there's a big show tonight
at the Amphitheater.


00:24:43.273 --> 00:24:49.530
Normally I skip it. But I thought...
well if you wanna go...


00:24:54.952 --> 00:24:57.455
Bong-bong... BONG-bong...


00:25:00.375 --> 00:25:01.835
Ha, ha, ha. We got it!


00:25:04.296 --> 00:25:06.256
But getting, and keeping,
are two different things.


00:25:06.381 --> 00:25:08.801
Back off, before you get hurt.


00:25:11.887 --> 00:25:15.641
#Got a date with Cordelia,
cause you're a big bad fish, ya.


00:25:15.808 --> 00:25:17.602
Zip it, Harry codfish junior.


00:25:17.685 --> 00:25:20.271
- Where you've been?
- I was hiding out.


00:25:21.356 --> 00:25:23.358
- From who?
- Squidnappers!


00:25:23.483 --> 00:25:25.944
That trying to steal
Nerissa's blue pearl, buddy boy.


00:25:26.069 --> 00:25:27.613
Well, come on!


00:25:27.779 --> 00:25:28.947
Hey!


00:25:29.573 --> 00:25:31.951
Dude! Oh fish!


00:25:32.076 --> 00:25:34.078
Now, I'm no fortune-teller, boys,


00:25:34.161 --> 00:25:36.748
but I can predict three things
that aren't gonna happen:


00:25:36.873 --> 00:25:39.334
You see,


00:25:39.501 --> 00:25:44.047
I'm not gonna get hurt.
I'm not gonna back off.


00:25:44.172 --> 00:25:45.340
We're gotta do something.


00:25:45.507 --> 00:25:47.843
Dude. Getting beat up once a day
isn't good enough for you?


00:25:48.010 --> 00:25:49.261
There's three of them!


00:25:49.386 --> 00:25:50.554
Get him!


00:26:01.775 --> 00:26:02.943
You took left!


00:26:08.782 --> 00:26:12.161
Hey, come back here!


00:26:20.295 --> 00:26:21.463
Trick or treat?


00:26:34.060 --> 00:26:36.062
Quit now, before you're calamari.


00:26:36.187 --> 00:26:39.440
I got the sauce right here.
I'm not afraid to use it.


00:26:40.066 --> 00:26:41.651
What a old man!


00:26:54.582 --> 00:26:56.667
You turtle!
I don't feel so good!


00:27:00.213 --> 00:27:02.048
See you later.


00:27:07.763 --> 00:27:10.266
Such big heads.
Such tiny brains.


00:27:10.391 --> 00:27:13.352
- Wow
- Turtlely awesome.


00:27:15.521 --> 00:27:16.647
Let's go.


00:27:22.195 --> 00:27:23.947
That old turtle's
unbelievable!


00:27:24.114 --> 00:27:27.201
- You boys saw Nerissa?
- Speak up, son.


00:27:27.284 --> 00:27:29.578
We saw Nerissa fight some squids!
He was amazing!


00:27:29.703 --> 00:27:30.955
Of course.


00:27:31.121 --> 00:27:34.166
That's why they call him
el macho tor tuga.


00:27:34.292 --> 00:27:36.335
Man he've got the moves awesomely
for an old coots.


00:27:36.461 --> 00:27:37.879
Oh, sorry.
Sorry about that old coots.


00:27:37.962 --> 00:27:41.049
- Huh?
- He said old coot!


00:27:41.174 --> 00:27:42.842
No, I did not toot!


00:27:42.968 --> 00:27:45.053
Why don't you accuse Manny for once?


00:27:45.178 --> 00:27:47.264
He blasts out more bubbles
than a scuba diver.


00:27:47.389 --> 00:27:49.433
What you say man?


00:27:49.642 --> 00:27:50.935
Hold up a second.
What' you say?


00:27:51.101 --> 00:27:55.940
That's it, viejo loco!
I've had enough of your insults!


00:27:56.607 --> 00:27:58.526
En garde! En garde!


00:28:00.069 --> 00:28:02.113
Spirit of the Sea!


00:28:02.280 --> 00:28:07.202
We ask your help in contacting,
Uncle Phil.


00:28:07.369 --> 00:28:09.580
He was last seen...


00:28:09.747 --> 00:28:10.414
La, la, la, LA,
la, la, la, LA!


00:28:10.539 --> 00:28:12.082
Where?
Where was he seen?


00:28:12.249 --> 00:28:14.418
I'm not listening,
I'm not listening this... La, la, la, LA,


00:28:14.543 --> 00:28:15.837
What're you doing?


00:28:15.962 --> 00:28:17.588
Dude, you saw
what was goin' on down there.


00:28:17.797 --> 00:28:19.007
My mom with all
her voodoo mumbo jumbo.


00:28:19.132 --> 00:28:22.802
Those séances are totally embarrassing.
You know what, I think you're right.


00:28:22.969 --> 00:28:24.221
I think swimming through
the middle of the room going,


00:28:24.346 --> 00:28:29.309
'La la, LA LA LA LA!' is
much more dignified.


00:28:29.518 --> 00:28:31.604
So what's that thing
your mom's always staring at?


00:28:31.770 --> 00:28:34.941
Oh, that's the pearl my dad gave her.


00:28:35.066 --> 00:28:38.820
You know the old saying,
'give a girl a pearl?


00:28:40.196 --> 00:28:42.490
Why would anyone want to
give a girl a pearl?


00:28:42.657 --> 00:28:46.286
Cause if she accepts it,
it means you'll be together forever.


00:28:46.453 --> 00:28:48.038
Anyway, My Mom thinks hers is magic.


00:28:48.163 --> 00:28:51.959
Hey, that's what those squids
were trying to steal from Nerissa... a pearl!


00:28:52.042 --> 00:28:55.505
You don't think he's gonna ask
some girl to marry him, do you?


00:28:55.671 --> 00:28:58.424
Oh, gross, no, dude!


00:28:58.549 --> 00:29:01.302
He's like 200 years old!
That's disgusting.


00:29:13.399 --> 00:29:15.359
- Hi!
- Hey!


00:29:21.658 --> 00:29:23.410
It's showtime!


00:29:31.043 --> 00:29:33.713
Welcome, to the Reef Amphitheater.


00:29:33.921 --> 00:29:38.134
We are proud to present
the Caribbean's most famous adventurer,


00:29:38.259 --> 00:29:42.347
who is here tonight to tell
the thrilling tales of his encounters


00:29:42.472 --> 00:29:44.850
with the sea's
most fearsome creatures.


00:29:44.975 --> 00:29:47.811
Ladies and gentlemen,
give up for... Thornton!


00:29:47.936 --> 00:29:51.440
And his back-up prawns,
the Kim Chi!


00:30:21.598 --> 00:30:26.019
I could make you all gasp
with just an average story


00:30:26.144 --> 00:30:29.523
for even my typical tales
are scary and gory


00:30:29.648 --> 00:30:38.408
But I know the adventure you're aching
to hear The most stupendous!


00:30:38.575 --> 00:30:43.622
And horrendous battle
of my entire career!


00:30:43.788 --> 00:30:46.625
He faced a creature that would
make you faint dead with fear!


00:30:46.792 --> 00:30:49.253
The most hideous sea monster
to ever appear!


00:30:49.378 --> 00:30:53.049
It had two mouths,
and on each mouth a sneer!


00:30:53.174 --> 00:30:55.593
It had two heads! And looked like
a giant brassier!


00:30:55.802 --> 00:31:00.432
I faced a sea monster
but I didn't make tracks.


00:31:00.598 --> 00:31:04.311
I stood face to face
and fought off her attacks.


00:31:04.519 --> 00:31:07.481
And I know that you'll
want to get all of the facts.


00:31:07.564 --> 00:31:10.526
So stick a fin in your ear
and dig out the wax.


00:31:10.651 --> 00:31:12.278
Dig the wax from your ears,
you'll seem more debonair


00:31:12.361 --> 00:31:16.324
'cause it looks like you've stuck
two big candles in there.


00:31:16.491 --> 00:31:21.746
It was a monstrous sea monster,
the size of a tanker!


00:31:21.871 --> 00:31:22.998
What did you do?


00:31:23.081 --> 00:31:25.250
I capsized and sank her.


00:31:25.375 --> 00:31:26.627
And then were you through?


00:31:26.793 --> 00:31:30.631
Not a bit! She was brawny.
And strong as an anchor!


00:31:30.798 --> 00:31:36.429
I had to get tough
I tickled and spanked her!


00:31:36.596 --> 00:31:38.306
What an amazing sight!


00:31:38.473 --> 00:31:40.934
When it was over
I thanked her.


00:31:41.518 --> 00:31:44.938
Because I am always polite.


00:31:45.063 --> 00:31:47.441
I'm fairly certain,
this guy is full of blowfish.


00:31:47.566 --> 00:31:51.278
I hear you say 'But!'
And you say 'Tut! Tut'


00:31:51.862 --> 00:31:54.448
Things are not always
what they appear


00:31:54.574 --> 00:31:57.827
I may have gray whiskers
and an oversized rear...


00:31:58.036 --> 00:32:01.122
His butt is humongous!
It must weigh a ton


00:32:01.247 --> 00:32:03.041
It frightens small children
And blots out the sun!


00:32:03.166 --> 00:32:04.876
What are you doing?


00:32:05.377 --> 00:32:08.213
That's not in the script!
Are you mad? You're running!


00:32:08.380 --> 00:32:11.634
It's a big bulging billowing
blubber-stuffed rump!


00:32:11.801 --> 00:32:15.137
It's bigger by far than
a humpback whale's hump!


00:32:19.767 --> 00:32:22.479
- Hey, Max! Bring up the music!
- Hit it boy! Quickly!


00:32:23.438 --> 00:32:26.024
Go Thornton!
You're humongous!


00:32:30.404 --> 00:32:31.947
Thank you!


00:32:38.580 --> 00:32:40.540
That was quite
an amazing story.


00:32:43.919 --> 00:32:46.046
It's getting late,
I guess I better go.


00:32:46.171 --> 00:32:49.425
No, wait. Don't go. Not yet.


00:32:49.591 --> 00:32:51.427
Well, I...


00:32:52.386 --> 00:32:56.933
- Have you ever been to the surface?
- No.


00:32:57.684 --> 00:32:58.851
Come on!


00:33:07.236 --> 00:33:08.529
Wow!


00:33:09.071 --> 00:33:11.532
See that set of stars over there?


00:33:11.657 --> 00:33:15.536
That's called the Big Dipper.
And that over there is the Little Dipper...


00:33:15.661 --> 00:33:17.413
I had no idea!


00:33:17.580 --> 00:33:21.418
And up there is
Leo and next to it, Gemini


00:33:21.584 --> 00:33:24.254
And see that one over there?
Well, that's me...


00:33:24.379 --> 00:33:25.797
Huh?


00:33:25.881 --> 00:33:28.425
Those stars are called Pisces.


00:33:28.592 --> 00:33:31.053
Pi is for Pisces.


00:33:31.971 --> 00:33:33.597
Beautiful...


00:33:38.603 --> 00:33:39.771
Boo! Let's get out of here!


00:33:40.980 --> 00:33:42.357
Hurry, Cordelia!


00:33:45.068 --> 00:33:46.820
You'd better be scared.


00:33:51.992 --> 00:33:54.537
- Well hello.
- Go, Pi. Leave me.


00:33:54.662 --> 00:33:56.080
I won't


00:33:56.164 --> 00:33:57.331
No!


00:34:00.293 --> 00:34:01.127
Leave him alone!


00:34:01.294 --> 00:34:03.338
Oh well I'm confused, baby,


00:34:03.505 --> 00:34:06.550
cause I thought you wanted
to be left alone,


00:34:06.717 --> 00:34:09.845
and yet I find you swimming around
with that piece of chum.


00:34:10.012 --> 00:34:13.599
It's none of your business what I do, Troy.
You don't own me.


00:34:13.683 --> 00:34:17.311
I'm a tiger shark, baby.
I own whatever I can take,


00:34:17.520 --> 00:34:20.356
and I take whatever I want.


00:34:21.399 --> 00:34:22.525
Troy!


00:34:22.776 --> 00:34:26.738
- Can I eat him?
- Eenie, meeney,


00:34:26.863 --> 00:34:29.199
- ah miney...
- Troy!


00:34:29.283 --> 00:34:31.952
Oh, what the heck.
Why don't you each take half?


00:34:32.578 --> 00:34:35.998
NO! Troy, if you let them do this,
I'll never forgive you.


00:34:36.082 --> 00:34:40.670
Forgiveness. I don't need
your stinking forgiveness.


00:34:42.088 --> 00:34:45.258
Please! Please!
If you don't hurt him...


00:34:46.593 --> 00:34:48.429
I'll do anything


00:34:48.595 --> 00:34:51.849
Like... anything, anything?


00:34:52.767 --> 00:34:55.937
If you leave Pi alone, and promise never
to come to the Reef again,


00:34:56.062 --> 00:34:59.941
- then... I'll... I'll...
- Yeah?


00:35:00.566 --> 00:35:02.944
Accept your pearl.


00:35:03.069 --> 00:35:05.572
- No!
- Hey!


00:35:05.738 --> 00:35:07.949
Let our little chum go.


00:35:09.618 --> 00:35:11.661
Cordelia, you can't...


00:35:11.787 --> 00:35:14.039
I'll be back at
the next full Moon.


00:35:16.083 --> 00:35:19.420
Wait till you see the pearl
I'm gonna bring you little girl.


00:35:21.005 --> 00:35:23.424
You'll change your mind
about me then.


00:35:23.591 --> 00:35:24.717
Vamanos!


00:35:26.386 --> 00:35:29.180
So baby, when I get back,
be ready.


00:35:29.264 --> 00:35:33.101
I got thirty days
to live it up and party!


00:35:33.685 --> 00:35:35.646
Who's the hotshot
who can't be caught?


00:35:35.771 --> 00:35:36.981
Troy!


00:35:38.107 --> 00:35:41.360
- Who's twice as mean as an ocelot?
- Troy!


00:35:43.196 --> 00:35:44.364
Oh, Pi...


00:35:57.545 --> 00:35:58.712
What could I do?


00:35:58.838 --> 00:36:02.508
You know the rules of the sea...
you can't leave a man adrift like that.


00:36:02.633 --> 00:36:05.011
Owww, my head...


00:36:07.263 --> 00:36:08.890
I wouldn't be so hasty, kid.


00:36:09.099 --> 00:36:11.935
That shark did quite a number
on your sorry tail.


00:36:12.644 --> 00:36:14.938
How did I get here?


00:36:15.063 --> 00:36:18.234
Well, the currents brought you here
and dumped ya outside.


00:36:18.818 --> 00:36:20.319
If it wasn't for your pretty lady friend.


00:36:20.444 --> 00:36:22.530
Cordelia! Is she all right?


00:36:22.697 --> 00:36:24.198
She spent the night bawlin'
at your side.


00:36:24.365 --> 00:36:26.659
I finally had to send her home
to get some peace and quiet around here.


00:36:26.785 --> 00:36:30.455
I've got to stop her.
She's gonna accept Troy's pearl.


00:36:30.956 --> 00:36:34.334
I sorry kid. She seemed very determined
to go through with it.


00:36:34.501 --> 00:36:36.211
Then I'll stop Troy.


00:36:36.378 --> 00:36:38.088
You're gonna to stop a tiger shark?


00:36:38.297 --> 00:36:40.257
Is that what just came
out of your mouth, just know?


00:36:40.341 --> 00:36:44.012
Yeah... you're right.


00:36:44.971 --> 00:36:49.059
Determined women and tiger sharks.
You don't pick easy fights, do ya kid?


00:36:49.142 --> 00:36:49.809
Well what about you?


00:36:50.018 --> 00:36:52.437
I ain't helping you with
your love life, kid. Forget it.


00:36:53.063 --> 00:36:55.774
- Everybody says your a wizard!
- Oh, do they now?


00:36:55.899 --> 00:36:58.110
Yeah, and I saw
you beat those squids.


00:36:58.277 --> 00:37:00.947
Three of them at once!
You totally rocked!


00:37:01.072 --> 00:37:02.740
Can you help me fight Troy?


00:37:02.824 --> 00:37:05.535
- Go fight your own battle kid.
- Please.


00:37:05.702 --> 00:37:07.912
Haven't you ever been
in love before?


00:37:09.331 --> 00:37:10.540
I'm sorry.


00:37:23.471 --> 00:37:29.311
Hey boychick,
why the long face?


00:37:29.477 --> 00:37:32.856
- I bet it's about a girl.
- Did you say Pearl?


00:37:32.981 --> 00:37:35.859
Actually, that't my problem.


00:37:35.943 --> 00:37:38.821
The girl I like... Cordelia
she's gonna accept Troy's pearl.


00:37:38.946 --> 00:37:40.740
That Troy's a punk!


00:37:40.865 --> 00:37:44.994
Why, back in my day,
we, we knew how to handle sharks like that.


00:37:45.161 --> 00:37:48.707
You never fought a shark, Jack.


00:37:48.873 --> 00:37:50.000
Oh yes I did.


00:37:50.167 --> 00:37:52.377
Took on a 25-foot hammerhead back in '71.


00:37:52.461 --> 00:37:54.922
- Really?
- Yep.


00:37:55.047 --> 00:37:58.342
Poked him right in the keister.
Right where the sun never shines.


00:37:58.884 --> 00:38:01.512
He'll never forget me,
I guarantee ya that.


00:38:01.679 --> 00:38:04.849
I wouldn't put a whole lotta stock
in what Jack says, chico.


00:38:05.016 --> 00:38:06.726
You calling me crazy?!


00:38:06.935 --> 00:38:08.687
You questioning
my credibility, boy?


00:38:08.895 --> 00:38:11.940
For about the tenth time today, yes!


00:38:12.649 --> 00:38:16.904
- All right! That's it. Put'm up.
- En garde!


00:38:24.495 --> 00:38:29.042
Hey! Would you guys
help me fight Troy?


00:38:29.167 --> 00:38:31.920
Get the seacup out of
your mouth, son. Speak up.


00:38:32.087 --> 00:38:35.632
He wants us to,
fight the SHARK!


00:38:36.383 --> 00:38:40.554
My back!


00:38:40.680 --> 00:38:44.058
Man! These cartilage crabs
are killin' me.


00:38:44.559 --> 00:38:48.396
Well, you see chico
we've what you call past our prime...


00:38:48.563 --> 00:38:54.403
Past our prime? We're old and feeble.
Over the hill. We're nearly buried, boychick.


00:38:54.570 --> 00:38:58.032
Listen. Fighting it's,
it is a young man's game.


00:38:58.157 --> 00:39:00.576
You need someone with a little more
'oomph' to his swim


00:39:00.701 --> 00:39:02.703
if you know what I'm talking about.


00:39:02.870 --> 00:39:04.831
Somebody more robust
and sportin' like Thornton.


00:39:04.956 --> 00:39:07.041
Thornton?
What about Thornton?


00:39:07.167 --> 00:39:09.461
That's it,
Someone more like Thornton


00:39:09.586 --> 00:39:14.550
Thorton? Agh. Well,
What've I gotta lose!


00:39:15.968 --> 00:39:20.139
Did I ever tell you boys
about the time I freed Willy?


00:39:20.264 --> 00:39:22.600
Aye, caramba.


00:39:26.479 --> 00:39:28.606
Now there's one minor change
I want to make to the act


00:39:28.815 --> 00:39:32.319
There will be no further references
to my rear end.


00:39:32.486 --> 00:39:35.781
That's my complex.


00:39:35.864 --> 00:39:39.034
You will cease comparing
its size and appearance to


00:39:39.160 --> 00:39:43.581
A) a tugboat, B) the planet Jupiter,
or C)...


00:39:43.664 --> 00:39:45.375
Mr. Thornton!


00:39:45.541 --> 00:39:47.252
Oh? You are a little early
for the show, my boy.


00:39:47.419 --> 00:39:49.212
My girl's engaged to a shark!


00:39:50.172 --> 00:39:51.423
SHARK?! Shark!
Where? Where?!


00:39:51.548 --> 00:39:54.009
My girl's engaged to a shark!


00:39:54.676 --> 00:39:56.011
You're girls engaged to a shark.


00:39:56.220 --> 00:39:58.639
Shocking.
Absolutely shocking.


00:39:58.764 --> 00:40:00.433
He's gonna take
Cordelia away.


00:40:01.684 --> 00:40:03.436
I need your help.
Will you fight him?


00:40:03.561 --> 00:40:07.440
You want me to fight a shark?
You've come unhinged, lad.


00:40:08.191 --> 00:40:10.861
I thought you fought a sea monster
as big as an oil tanker.


00:40:10.986 --> 00:40:14.782
- Who said that?
- You did. Last night.


00:40:14.865 --> 00:40:18.244
I did? Oh, yes that's
right, I did.


00:40:18.369 --> 00:40:22.915
Yes, but you see, that doesn't count,
because I said it in rhyme.


00:40:23.040 --> 00:40:27.420
That's what we call
poetic al license.


00:40:30.298 --> 00:40:31.258
You mean you lied.


00:40:31.383 --> 00:40:34.178
Well, I, I... I may have
exaggerated for dramatic effect.


00:40:34.261 --> 00:40:39.225
But... And anyway, I, I'm sure


00:40:39.391 --> 00:40:42.061
I said it was more the size
of a... kayak.


00:40:42.562 --> 00:40:44.439
Thanks for nothing.


00:40:44.564 --> 00:40:47.442
Don't worry lad,
There's plenty more fish in the sea.


00:40:49.569 --> 00:40:53.656
- Well, would you fight a shark?
- You're nothing but a fat booty!


00:41:03.375 --> 00:41:08.548
All right, I got the most
beautiful girl on the Reef.


00:41:08.673 --> 00:41:11.551
Now I've just gotta find
the most beautiful pearl.


00:41:11.718 --> 00:41:14.846
But Troy, finding something
like that could take months.


00:41:14.971 --> 00:41:19.226
Yeah, If we were morons!


00:41:19.393 --> 00:41:22.062
Who's got the best one
on the reef?


00:41:22.187 --> 00:41:25.441
Hey... Nerissa.
He has a blue pearl.


00:41:25.608 --> 00:41:27.401
It's the only one on the Reef, see?


00:41:27.485 --> 00:41:32.448
Perfect. Go get it, and bring it back.
Problem solved.


00:41:32.574 --> 00:41:36.328
They say he's kind'a tough,
this Nerissa


00:41:36.453 --> 00:41:40.541
Are you tellin' me that
you are not tougher than a ta too... turtle?


00:41:40.666 --> 00:41:44.253
Are you an idiot?
Are you?


00:41:44.378 --> 00:41:46.338
Well... I...


00:41:46.464 --> 00:41:48.925
Who can part the sea
like Charlton Heston?


00:41:49.091 --> 00:41:49.842
Troy!


00:41:49.967 --> 00:41:53.346
Who's tougher than you all,
even when he's just restin?


00:41:53.471 --> 00:41:54.139
Troy!


00:41:54.305 --> 00:41:58.226
Who's gonna do what I say,
or find themselves in my large intestine?


00:41:59.186 --> 00:42:01.480
- Us.
- That's right!


00:42:05.317 --> 00:42:06.527
What am I gonna do?


00:42:06.652 --> 00:42:07.820
PI!


00:42:08.863 --> 00:42:11.324
I'm not worthy.
I'm not worthy!


00:42:11.491 --> 00:42:12.742
Dylan, what are you doing?


00:42:12.867 --> 00:42:16.955
Dude, you are my idol!
Dude, don't play dumb with me, man.


00:42:17.080 --> 00:42:20.125
You didn't come home last night
from your hot date with Cordelia.


00:42:20.292 --> 00:42:22.878
But don't worry,
I got ya covered with mom.


00:42:23.003 --> 00:42:24.797
So... details, please.


00:42:24.880 --> 00:42:28.426
I got beat up by Troy and
Cordelia agreed to accept his Pearl.


00:42:28.634 --> 00:42:29.135
What?


00:42:29.302 --> 00:42:33.348
She agreed to accept Troy's pearl
if he stopped pummeling my head.


00:42:33.556 --> 00:42:36.226
- So, the date didn't go well?
- Not exactly...


00:42:36.768 --> 00:42:37.936
DUCK!


00:42:39.855 --> 00:42:41.857
I don't feel good about this.


00:42:41.982 --> 00:42:43.442
- Dude, what the?
- Shhhh!


00:42:43.984 --> 00:42:47.446
Everyone says that old turtle is a wizard.


00:42:47.571 --> 00:42:50.032
They say that old shipwreck
he lives in is haunted with ghosts.


00:42:50.241 --> 00:42:53.244
It sounds spooky.


00:42:53.870 --> 00:42:57.457
You know what you are?
You're a disgrace to vicious predators! See?


00:42:57.582 --> 00:43:02.254
If Troy tells us to go steal Nerissa's pearl
then we go steal Nerissa's pearl.


00:43:02.379 --> 00:43:04.048
Okay, I'll do it.


00:43:04.215 --> 00:43:06.550
Okay, Magellan, Which way is
that stupid shipwreck?


00:43:06.759 --> 00:43:10.221
- I think it's that way.
- Wrong way dummy!


00:43:10.388 --> 00:43:13.558
- That was close, dude.
- Come on, we gotta warn Nerissa.


00:43:13.683 --> 00:43:14.851
Dude...


00:43:15.977 --> 00:43:18.480
Oh... fish... Dude!


00:43:18.981 --> 00:43:21.442
- Dude!
- Nerissa!


00:43:22.192 --> 00:43:22.860
Nerissa!


00:43:22.985 --> 00:43:25.654
Oh well, no one's home.
We tried Bye bye!


00:43:31.285 --> 00:43:32.328
Nerissa!


00:43:32.495 --> 00:43:34.539
Dude, nobody's here. And if they are
they don't wanna be disturbed.


00:43:34.706 --> 00:43:35.749
Let's just go.


00:43:35.957 --> 00:43:37.000
Oh-oh...


00:43:37.083 --> 00:43:39.544
Well. Look who's here.


00:43:39.711 --> 00:43:41.046
Oh God, no!


00:43:42.798 --> 00:43:43.924
Let go of me!


00:43:44.091 --> 00:43:47.845
All right, stupid!
First we get them, then the pearl.


00:43:50.098 --> 00:43:53.017
- Dylan!
- We're coming for you, chum!


00:43:59.650 --> 00:44:01.610
Hey! They're down there!
Come on!


00:44:02.945 --> 00:44:04.154
But, Bart!


00:44:07.658 --> 00:44:10.161
- I don't like this...
- Stop your whining.


00:44:10.661 --> 00:44:12.121
Come on! Let's go! Let's go.
We gotta go


00:44:12.247 --> 00:44:14.124
No! We can't let them
get Nerissa's pearl.


00:44:14.249 --> 00:44:16.376
- I'm just, just...
- Don't freak out on me!


00:44:16.543 --> 00:44:17.919
I'll figure something out.


00:44:22.049 --> 00:44:26.220
- Hey, what's that?
- It's... I don't know...


00:44:42.654 --> 00:44:45.241
- Not bad. Not bad at all...
- Pardon?


00:44:46.200 --> 00:44:50.204
You're got more nerve
than I thought.


00:44:50.997 --> 00:44:54.709
Maybe I can do something about
with your little problem with Troy.


00:44:54.876 --> 00:44:57.587
Be here tomorrow, sunrise,
begin your training.


00:44:57.796 --> 00:45:00.299
My what? My training?


00:45:00.465 --> 00:45:02.634
Dude, you're going to teach Pi
how to fight Troy?


00:45:02.801 --> 00:45:05.638
I'm going to teach the Kid
how to defeat Troy.


00:45:05.763 --> 00:45:08.099
Sunrise!
Not one second later


00:45:09.142 --> 00:45:10.601
- Cool!
- Dude!


00:45:13.563 --> 00:45:14.731
Pi!


00:45:15.315 --> 00:45:17.275
I can't let you go.


00:45:17.400 --> 00:45:19.611
I've heard from
the ethereal netherworld,


00:45:19.778 --> 00:45:23.908
and they think this is
an incredibly stupid idea.


00:45:24.533 --> 00:45:28.037
You said I'd find my destiny
on the Reef. Well I did.


00:45:28.162 --> 00:45:30.957
And I'm about to lose her,
just like I lost my parents.


00:45:31.040 --> 00:45:33.001
I couldn't do anything to save them,
and maybe I can't save Cordelia.


00:45:33.168 --> 00:45:35.629
and maybe I can't save Cordelia.


00:45:35.795 --> 00:45:36.922
But Aunt Pearl...
I've got to try.


00:45:47.183 --> 00:45:49.644
I'm gonna regret this...


00:45:49.769 --> 00:45:51.020
All right, Kid,


00:45:51.187 --> 00:45:53.022
We're gonna take a trip
through the Canyon.


00:45:53.189 --> 00:45:55.609
And if you can keep up
and if you're still in one piece at the end


00:45:55.734 --> 00:45:57.402
then we'll go on.


00:45:57.527 --> 00:46:00.697
If not, I'll send what's left
of you home in a doggy bag.


00:46:00.864 --> 00:46:03.617
- I can keep up.
- We'll see about that, kid.


00:46:12.669 --> 00:46:15.213
This is nothing!
I can go twice as fast as this!


00:46:15.380 --> 00:46:17.007
It isn't what you can do on
the straightaway,


00:46:17.174 --> 00:46:19.009
Kid. It's the turns that'll get ya.


00:46:24.056 --> 00:46:27.727
The Reef isn’t just a pretty place to sightsee,
it can be your best weapon.


00:46:27.893 --> 00:46:31.522
But to use it against your opponent,
you've gotta master it yourself!


00:46:34.150 --> 00:46:35.694
Elkhorn coral. Razor sharp.


00:46:35.860 --> 00:46:38.405
If you're lucky, it'll just
scrape off a patch of skin.


00:46:39.656 --> 00:46:43.077
If you're unlucky, you'll get
to see your own skeleton.


00:46:43.577 --> 00:46:46.706
Fire coral. One touch and it can burn
a hole right through your fin.


00:46:51.794 --> 00:46:54.422
This section of the canyon is
called Bottleneck Alley.


00:46:55.090 --> 00:46:57.843
Some folks find a dark,
enclosed space disorienting.


00:46:59.970 --> 00:47:03.307
Plus, there's lots of rocks
for them to bump their head on.


00:47:04.767 --> 00:47:08.020
Remember this place, kid.
I will ask questions later.


00:47:08.145 --> 00:47:11.441
See you tomorrow,
same time, same place.


00:47:14.861 --> 00:47:20.075
If we get the crazy lady's pearl,
maybe Troy will forgive us.


00:47:20.200 --> 00:47:22.411
For what happened at the wreck?
He already has.


00:47:22.578 --> 00:47:25.873
- Are you sure?
- Yeah. I told him it was your fault.


00:47:25.998 --> 00:47:29.627
What? That isn't true!


00:47:29.836 --> 00:47:32.338
- What's your point?
- You are a liar!


00:47:32.463 --> 00:47:35.300
Of course I lied.
I'm an evil henchman.


00:47:36.051 --> 00:47:38.929
I am an evil henchman also!


00:47:39.054 --> 00:47:41.932
- You're not evil.
- I am so!


00:47:42.057 --> 00:47:45.102
If you were evil,
you wouldn't care about me lying.


00:47:45.269 --> 00:47:48.356
You think I'd care
if you told lies about me?


00:47:48.481 --> 00:47:50.817
I wouldn't tell lies about you!


00:47:50.983 --> 00:47:54.904
Exactly.
Because you're not evil!


00:47:56.573 --> 00:47:58.325
I'm kinda evil.


00:48:01.036 --> 00:48:04.331
All right, so you're pretty fast
and agile for a fish. I'll give you that.


00:48:04.498 --> 00:48:06.625
But still I'm tiny,
compared to Troy.


00:48:06.834 --> 00:48:08.961
Yeah, and Troy's tiny
compared to the sea.


00:48:09.670 --> 00:48:13.424
You learn to make the ocean work for ya,
and size won't matter.


00:48:13.550 --> 00:48:16.094
You get water dense enough,
and it becomes a weapon.


00:48:18.471 --> 00:48:22.434
What are you doing?


00:48:29.274 --> 00:48:34.822
Please! Help! Nerissa!


00:48:34.989 --> 00:48:38.034
- ladies and gentleman. Place your bets!
- Help! Nerissa!


00:48:39.369 --> 00:48:42.163
No! Wha... Please!
I'm gonna be sick!


00:48:42.289 --> 00:48:46.126
A fish gettin' sea sick.
Now I've seen everything!


00:48:46.752 --> 00:48:48.420
No barfing on the poop deck.


00:48:50.881 --> 00:48:54.802
Yes, yes, yes!
I want her to wear it up.


00:48:54.969 --> 00:48:59.516
WAY UP for her
next photo spread! That is supreme.


00:48:59.682 --> 00:49:02.060
Now tease it.
Tease it! TEASE IT!


00:49:02.185 --> 00:49:05.355
You're squeezing it! I said tease it!
Don't get huffy with me crab face.


00:49:05.480 --> 00:49:08.233
I scratch your eyes out.


00:49:08.400 --> 00:49:12.530
Ach do leber.
This is so you. I just LUV it!


00:49:13.072 --> 00:49:16.826
Please, sea shells
were so last year.


00:49:17.243 --> 00:49:18.661
The shells are fine...


00:49:18.745 --> 00:49:22.707
Oh honey,
you look so beautiful...


00:49:22.874 --> 00:49:24.835
No, babe,


00:49:24.960 --> 00:49:29.506
don't look so glum I wish
I had two boys fighting over me.


00:49:29.673 --> 00:49:31.175
What are you
talking about?


00:49:33.260 --> 00:49:35.555
Max...
what's he talking about?


00:49:36.180 --> 00:49:39.225
Darling, you have
enough on your mind.


00:49:39.392 --> 00:49:41.895
I don't want you
worrying about some riffraff Romeo.


00:49:42.020 --> 00:49:45.649
- The girl has got a right to know.
- I second that...


00:49:45.816 --> 00:49:49.027
Well, your admirer.
The red one with the cute white stripe.


00:49:49.153 --> 00:49:50.195
You mean Pi?


00:49:50.362 --> 00:49:52.823
He's been working out with
that crazy old wizard turtle


00:49:52.948 --> 00:49:55.034
learning how to fight
so he can beat up Troy when he comes.


00:49:55.159 --> 00:49:56.327
No!


00:49:58.288 --> 00:50:00.248
I hope it wasn't anything I said.


00:50:00.415 --> 00:50:03.043
I don't like fighting.
I like loving.


00:50:03.585 --> 00:50:07.840
Eddie's not evil...
Eddie's not evil!


00:50:07.965 --> 00:50:12.428
Shut up!
I am so! See! I said shut up!


00:50:12.595 --> 00:50:14.639
That's not evil.
That's just rude.


00:50:14.805 --> 00:50:19.644
Well my mom always said,
rudeness is the root of all evil.


00:50:19.853 --> 00:50:24.024
I win! Evil henchmen don't talk
about their mothers!


00:50:25.275 --> 00:50:27.110
No...


00:50:28.153 --> 00:50:30.155
All right, play time is over.


00:50:30.281 --> 00:50:33.659
I've shown you ways
to confuse and trap your opponent.


00:50:34.368 --> 00:50:37.622
But you must train yourself to move
and react faster than him.


00:50:37.789 --> 00:50:39.249
Let's see what you can do.


00:50:39.415 --> 00:50:41.126
Swim the obstacle course
as fast as you can.


00:50:41.334 --> 00:50:42.544
Go!


00:50:43.003 --> 00:50:45.047
Swim like you life
defended on it!


00:50:46.506 --> 00:50:48.050
Cause it just might.


00:50:49.301 --> 00:50:51.762
Come on!
Put some fish oil into it!


00:50:51.887 --> 00:50:54.265
All right, now,
off the mast!


00:50:56.476 --> 00:50:57.852
Over the sail!


00:50:59.687 --> 00:51:01.523
Watch out!


00:51:05.861 --> 00:51:08.030
I guess I should have
explained myself.


00:51:08.197 --> 00:51:11.033
The idea of an obstacle course
is to avoid the obstacles.


00:51:11.992 --> 00:51:14.245
Now, if the idea was
to demolish my home with your face,


00:51:14.370 --> 00:51:16.497
you'd be doing great.
Try it again.


00:51:16.581 --> 00:51:18.958
- But
- And this time, do it fast!


00:51:19.792 --> 00:51:20.960
Do it fast?


00:51:21.586 --> 00:51:22.754
Go!


00:51:26.508 --> 00:51:28.844
- Pi!
- Cordelia!


00:51:29.053 --> 00:51:30.846
I can't let you do it, Pi.


00:51:31.013 --> 00:51:33.349
I make my own decisions,
and I've chosen Troy.


00:51:33.474 --> 00:51:34.517
Because you love him?


00:51:34.684 --> 00:51:37.437
He promised to leave you alone
and the Reef alone!


00:51:37.562 --> 00:51:41.358
- Do you really believe he'll keep his promise?
- I have to believe it.


00:51:45.487 --> 00:51:50.034
If you can believe in him...
then why can't you believe in me?


00:51:56.290 --> 00:51:58.918
Did you hear about the kid
who's gonna fight Troy?


00:52:00.211 --> 00:52:02.005
Like we don't have
enough problems with Troy.


00:52:02.213 --> 00:52:03.340
This is only gonna make him madder.


00:52:03.423 --> 00:52:04.382
Huh?


00:52:04.549 --> 00:52:08.011
Exactly! And who's he gonna
take it out on? Us!


00:52:08.178 --> 00:52:10.180
Well, maybe after he eats the kid
he'll feel too bloated


00:52:10.347 --> 00:52:12.183
and lethargic to chase anybody else.


00:52:12.349 --> 00:52:15.520
Good point! You shouldn't swim
for at least half an hour after eating,


00:52:15.645 --> 00:52:18.940
so maybe he'll get a cramp
and we can all hide.


00:52:24.446 --> 00:52:28.992
Spirit of the Sea?
It's Pearl calling.


00:52:29.159 --> 00:52:33.456
You know, it's too much to ask
that he actually be able to win.


00:52:33.581 --> 00:52:35.208
But please...


00:52:35.416 --> 00:52:40.088
if everyone who loves Pi could
just be there for him when the time comes...


00:52:40.296 --> 00:52:43.341
Well, I'd really owe you one.


00:52:47.429 --> 00:52:50.599
Percy... I had the strangest dream.


00:52:50.766 --> 00:52:51.517
Me too,


00:52:51.642 --> 00:52:53.060
Was it about Pi?


00:52:53.144 --> 00:52:56.606
Yes. I have the feeling
something awful is about to happen...


00:52:57.357 --> 00:52:59.901
- Not evil.
- I am so evil!


00:53:00.068 --> 00:53:02.404
Not evil. I win!


00:53:07.367 --> 00:53:11.789
Eddie... I am your father.
Join me!


00:53:12.498 --> 00:53:15.251
Oh wait, you're not evil enough.


00:53:15.376 --> 00:53:19.881
Stop Now!
You know it gives me the willies!


00:53:20.048 --> 00:53:22.801
Evil henchmen don't
get the willies.


00:53:22.968 --> 00:53:24.719
They give the willies.


00:53:24.845 --> 00:53:27.389
You don't have one evil scale
all over you!


00:53:27.556 --> 00:53:31.727
Yes, we're all very scaled down here,
but must you be so loud?


00:53:33.646 --> 00:53:36.023
See? I am evil.


00:53:36.149 --> 00:53:38.109
Let go get that pearl!


00:53:41.696 --> 00:53:44.908
Nerissa? How come you
live in that old wreck?


00:53:45.033 --> 00:53:46.618
Why don't you live on the Reef
with everyone else?


00:53:46.743 --> 00:53:48.120
What are you, a priest?


00:53:48.662 --> 00:53:50.205
Well, uh... no.


00:53:50.372 --> 00:53:53.000
Good! 'cause I don't remember
goin' to confession.


00:53:53.167 --> 00:53:57.714
Now listen up... You think you're fast,
and maybe you are. But so is Troy.


00:53:57.839 --> 00:53:58.506
I know.


00:53:58.673 --> 00:54:01.176
But the ocean's faster
than both of you.


00:54:01.301 --> 00:54:02.427
Come on.


00:54:08.350 --> 00:54:11.145
This is the West Indies Current.


00:54:11.812 --> 00:54:12.980
Come on!


00:54:15.066 --> 00:54:17.902
This is great!
Why don't all fish do this?


00:54:18.027 --> 00:54:20.739
Because we're not the only one's
using the current.


00:54:20.864 --> 00:54:22.324
Portuguese Man O'war.


00:54:22.449 --> 00:54:24.910
One of the deadliest
creatures in the ocean.


00:54:27.329 --> 00:54:30.207
One of the deadliest creatures
in the ocean.


00:54:30.374 --> 00:54:32.501
Notice the tentacles?
Almost transparent;


00:54:32.668 --> 00:54:35.254
easy to swim right into 'em. One touch,
and a big fish is paralyzed.


00:54:35.379 --> 00:54:38.633
One touch,
and a fish your size is dead.


00:54:39.342 --> 00:54:40.927
DEAD!


00:54:51.146 --> 00:54:55.526
- What happened?
- Someone broke in and stole Mom's pearl.


00:54:55.693 --> 00:54:57.904
This is a bad omen, dude.


00:54:58.696 --> 00:55:01.825
Stop it, Dylan! There's nothing
mystical about this, Honestly,


00:55:01.950 --> 00:55:04.995
I don't know where you get that from.
We just got robbed, kids.


00:55:05.162 --> 00:55:08.207
We just got robbed, kids.


00:55:08.415 --> 00:55:10.542
It happens.
Even in the nicest neighborhoods.


00:55:10.668 --> 00:55:17.091
I'm a... I'm just a,
going to clean up down here is all.


00:55:17.216 --> 00:55:18.551
Good night.


00:55:22.973 --> 00:55:26.226
It's a sign.
It's a terrible sign.


00:55:26.351 --> 00:55:28.312
My dad gave her that pearl.


00:55:29.646 --> 00:55:32.107
Hey, Dude.
Forget all this, huh?


00:55:32.274 --> 00:55:35.403
We'll run away and find your friend Percy.
We'll migrate with the dolphins.


00:55:35.611 --> 00:55:37.905
- Porpoises.
- Whatever.


00:55:38.072 --> 00:55:41.326
I wish we could, Dyl.
But I made a promise.


00:55:41.493 --> 00:55:45.580
To who? Cordelia? Dude,
she doesn't even want you to fight Troy.


00:55:45.664 --> 00:55:49.835
Maybe not. But if I break my word,
she'll have to go off with Troy,


00:55:50.419 --> 00:55:51.837
and I'll have to live with that.


00:55:51.962 --> 00:55:57.135
Pi, I take back what I said before.
You're 100% non-dork.


00:55:59.012 --> 00:56:04.226
Oh, Dude. Sorry. Now that was
the uncoolest thing I've ever done.


00:56:04.351 --> 00:56:05.602
It's o-


00:56:05.811 --> 00:56:08.981
And you're 99% feeb-free.


00:56:25.499 --> 00:56:28.752
What's that Captain? How am I supposed
to now what's wrong with him?


00:56:28.877 --> 00:56:33.799
Maybe he's one of those farm fresh fish
or something? Genetic malcontents.


00:56:38.346 --> 00:56:39.639
Look, this is stupid!


00:56:39.764 --> 00:56:42.225
I thought you were gonna teach me
how to fight like you.


00:56:42.350 --> 00:56:43.727
I don't stand a chance.


00:56:44.561 --> 00:56:45.729
NO!


00:56:46.021 --> 00:56:47.439
Hey! Get away from there!


00:56:47.564 --> 00:56:50.234
Don't ever touch it again!
Do you understand?


00:56:50.359 --> 00:56:53.821
I'm... I'm sorry!
What's the big deal?


00:56:54.780 --> 00:56:59.035
It's the pearl I gave my wife.
And it's all I have left of her.


00:56:59.202 --> 00:57:01.663
Used to be, folks stuck together.


00:57:02.414 --> 00:57:04.624
Then they put
in the Wildlife Sanctuary,


00:57:04.750 --> 00:57:06.919
and everybody forgot what
it was like to be hunted.


00:57:07.461 --> 00:57:12.174
When my wife got hooked out
on Flatbottom,


00:57:12.299 --> 00:57:13.926
I begged for help.


00:57:14.093 --> 00:57:17.180
But nobody came,
they all hid on the Reef, where it's safe.


00:57:18.181 --> 00:57:19.432
I'm sorry.


00:57:19.557 --> 00:57:23.061
Listen, Kid, I never told you
I'd teach you how to fight the shark.


00:57:23.186 --> 00:57:25.355
I never would,
cause you'd never win.


00:57:25.480 --> 00:57:28.942
- Then what...
- I told you I'd teach you how to defeat him.


00:57:29.068 --> 00:57:31.445
- But how?
- With your brain.


00:57:31.612 --> 00:57:34.573
What's stronger than Troy?


00:57:34.740 --> 00:57:37.118
- Bigger? Faster.
- The sea.


00:57:37.243 --> 00:57:39.829
But what's to stop him
from using them against me?


00:57:39.954 --> 00:57:43.208
Troy always picks on folks
who are smaller and weaker.


00:57:43.416 --> 00:57:46.628
He has never had to learn about things
bigger than himself.


00:57:46.753 --> 00:57:51.258
I understand how to use all this stuff
to avoid Troy, but how do I defeat him?


00:57:51.383 --> 00:57:55.429
You offer something he wants,
and then give him something he doesn't want.


00:57:55.555 --> 00:57:57.640
You're shark bait, kid, like it or not.


00:57:57.765 --> 00:57:59.225
And the Reef's the hook.


00:58:06.274 --> 00:58:10.821
- Hey! Boychik!
- Hey, Moe.


00:58:10.946 --> 00:58:13.240
You look limper than a slice of lox.


00:58:13.866 --> 00:58:16.243
I guess he's being pretty tough
on you, huh?


00:58:16.368 --> 00:58:19.538
Yeah, he was always like that,
to build a higher.


00:58:19.663 --> 00:58:21.958
- You know him?
- Nerissa? Oh sure.


00:58:22.083 --> 00:58:25.336
We were all of us pretty close,
back before his... uh Well.


00:58:26.921 --> 00:58:30.675
That's a long story.
You better go back to bed, boychik.


00:58:30.801 --> 00:58:34.137
If I know that old turtle,
tomorrow's only gonna be worse.


00:58:35.806 --> 00:58:38.476
Listen, Pi. If you get a chance,
you tell Nerissa...


00:58:38.601 --> 00:58:41.646
You, you, you tell
him Moe says Hi.


00:58:41.812 --> 00:58:44.607
And... uh... that I'm sorry.


00:58:57.663 --> 00:59:01.000
Well, it's my last day
of training.


00:59:01.083 --> 00:59:07.590
Oh, Pi... I... I see a great destiny
for you, my darling.


00:59:07.716 --> 00:59:09.843
Really, are you just making that up?


00:59:10.010 --> 00:59:12.763
What are you kidding me?
I could lose my license.


00:59:12.888 --> 00:59:16.141
You're talking to someone
that read the fin of the con-father.


00:59:16.266 --> 00:59:21.647
I'm telling ya,
I see love, honesty, courage.


00:59:22.482 --> 00:59:28.947
You're destined for great things.
And don't you forget it, mister.


00:59:43.087 --> 00:59:46.132
Pretty good, kid.
But we still got some work to do.


00:59:56.852 --> 00:59:58.813
Un-fishin' believable.


00:59:58.938 --> 01:00:03.818
What's that captain? Huh? Heh!
The Captain is embarrassed for you.


01:00:03.943 --> 01:00:05.486
And he doesn't even exist.


01:00:05.653 --> 01:00:08.615
You can tell the Captain
I get the POINT!


01:00:17.666 --> 01:00:20.002
- You're ready.
- I am?


01:00:20.169 --> 01:00:25.884
Well, you better be.


01:00:29.930 --> 01:00:34.434
TROY! TROY! TROY!


01:00:36.478 --> 01:00:39.982
I just want to thank everyone here
for coming to my bachelor party.


01:00:40.191 --> 01:00:43.403
I feel like the luckiest shark
in the whole world.


01:00:43.528 --> 01:00:46.239
I never though you would be
the first one to go, squirt!


01:00:46.865 --> 01:00:50.327
What's the old ball
and chain for the little shrimp?


01:00:50.452 --> 01:00:52.871
It'll never last...


01:00:53.372 --> 01:00:58.002
Man, I love you dudes!


01:00:58.127 --> 01:01:00.379
You know I got the hottest babe
on the reef


01:01:00.546 --> 01:01:02.381
but more importantly,


01:01:02.590 --> 01:01:04.759
I got the best buds that the shark
could ever have!


01:01:04.842 --> 01:01:07.095
Who's goina'
have a good time tonight,


01:01:07.220 --> 01:01:10.307
before the old ball
and chain takes away his bite?


01:01:10.473 --> 01:01:12.100
TROY!


01:01:24.197 --> 01:01:27.617
- Beautiful huh?
- Cordelia!?


01:01:27.784 --> 01:01:28.827
What are you doing here?


01:01:28.994 --> 01:01:30.704
I like to come up here...


01:01:31.329 --> 01:01:33.290
because it reminds me of you.


01:01:40.047 --> 01:01:41.632
You need to make a wish.


01:01:46.971 --> 01:01:48.473
What'd ya wish for?


01:01:49.474 --> 01:01:52.102
That you come to your senses
before tomorrow...


01:02:08.078 --> 01:02:10.705
SSSSSSShark!


01:02:21.050 --> 01:02:23.469
- Where's Pi?
- Now you show up?


01:02:23.594 --> 01:02:27.932
Model schmodel.
That brave boy has left already


01:02:28.058 --> 01:02:30.560
No! I've got to stop him!


01:02:31.186 --> 01:02:32.646
Cordelia, wait!


01:02:32.771 --> 01:02:35.023
We should have stopped Troy
a long time ago,


01:02:35.232 --> 01:02:36.692
but we were all too scared.


01:02:36.817 --> 01:02:37.902
Well I won't let Pi throw his life away


01:02:38.027 --> 01:02:39.904
standing up for fish
who won’t even stand up for themselves!


01:02:40.071 --> 01:02:42.031
Who decides if it's life or it's death?


01:02:56.171 --> 01:02:58.757
Who can eat a whole
school of salmon


01:02:58.841 --> 01:03:03.221
and still have minty fresh breath?


01:03:03.346 --> 01:03:04.013
Troy!


01:03:04.180 --> 01:03:07.142
Who ain't afraid of
no fishin' pole?


01:03:07.267 --> 01:03:09.811
Who makes the babes
all lose control?


01:03:09.936 --> 01:03:12.606
Who can't be flushed down
no toilet bowl?


01:03:12.731 --> 01:03:13.440
Troy!


01:03:13.523 --> 01:03:17.903
Well, well, well.
Chicken of the sea.


01:03:18.112 --> 01:03:21.824
Troy. If you want to take Cordelia,
you'll have to go through me first.


01:03:21.991 --> 01:03:25.161
It'll be my pleasure, chum.


01:03:25.244 --> 01:03:29.416
You guys stay back.
Cause this one's mine...


01:03:38.175 --> 01:03:39.927
You're just prolonging the agony!


01:03:40.094 --> 01:03:42.680
Actually,
I'm postponing the agony!


01:03:45.475 --> 01:03:48.728
What's a matter, Troy?
Can't keep up with a piece of chum?


01:03:48.853 --> 01:03:50.730
You are so dead!


01:03:50.856 --> 01:03:53.275
You gotta catch me first!


01:03:55.736 --> 01:03:57.279
Here I come!


01:04:04.912 --> 01:04:07.624
Elkhorn coral!
Razor sharp!


01:04:14.298 --> 01:04:16.925
Fire coral.
Wouldn't wanna touch that!


01:04:21.931 --> 01:04:23.725
Oh-oh,
tight squeeze up ahead!


01:04:28.063 --> 01:04:30.524
No, no, no, no.


01:04:44.288 --> 01:04:47.542
Stop, stop. Stop,
please stop, stop the spinning!


01:04:47.709 --> 01:04:49.502
I'm gonna hurl!


01:04:49.628 --> 01:04:51.004
A sea-sick shark.


01:04:51.171 --> 01:04:54.216
A sea-sick shark.
Now I've seen everything.


01:04:54.341 --> 01:04:56.552
Welcome to Bottle neck alley!


01:05:04.310 --> 01:05:07.731
No, no!


01:05:07.856 --> 01:05:10.358
Troy, I can't beat you in a fight.


01:05:10.483 --> 01:05:11.943
But I can certainly out think you.


01:05:12.110 --> 01:05:16.156
Help me! Help me!
Guys, help me!


01:05:16.281 --> 01:05:20.077
Please!
I'm endangered species!


01:05:21.287 --> 01:05:22.747
Cheese!


01:05:31.381 --> 01:05:33.926
Come on guys!
Yeah, yeah, that's good!


01:05:34.051 --> 01:05:35.219
No!


01:05:47.774 --> 01:05:49.943
Yeah, Out of reef
and out of luck, buddy.


01:05:58.744 --> 01:06:01.205
I got you now!


01:06:06.252 --> 01:06:08.672
Get him! You idiots!


01:06:08.797 --> 01:06:10.674
We're coming for you, chum!


01:06:17.181 --> 01:06:20.142
Time you boys got the boots!


01:06:27.317 --> 01:06:30.153
- Wait!
- No, What do you want?


01:06:30.278 --> 01:06:32.906
You took my mom's pearl.
Give it back.


01:06:33.115 --> 01:06:35.159
Chunky boy here wants to fight?


01:06:35.242 --> 01:06:36.410
Give it back!


01:06:37.369 --> 01:06:39.538
Wait!


01:06:40.581 --> 01:06:41.624
Bart, I'm scared!


01:06:41.791 --> 01:06:45.211
What I say about going into my hole!
What I say! It's my hole!


01:06:45.378 --> 01:06:46.671
You gonna pay the price,
here coming pitching!


01:06:49.257 --> 01:06:51.134
Wait! Stop! I'm sorry! Oh my...


01:06:51.968 --> 01:06:52.678
Hey, Troy.


01:06:52.761 --> 01:06:56.849
Nobody makes those idiots
look like idiots except me!


01:07:00.978 --> 01:07:03.356
Ready to go for
a big ride, Troy?


01:07:06.192 --> 01:07:07.944
Portuguese Man O'war.


01:07:15.160 --> 01:07:17.538
Watch out for the tentacles?


01:07:25.088 --> 01:07:27.132
No!


01:07:40.771 --> 01:07:41.522
Pi!


01:07:41.647 --> 01:07:43.024
Stay back, guys!


01:07:44.484 --> 01:07:45.818
Be careful!


01:07:54.244 --> 01:07:57.414
Kid! You all right?


01:08:02.044 --> 01:08:03.212
Nerissa!


01:08:05.256 --> 01:08:08.468
Ah, yeah. Nerissa.


01:08:08.593 --> 01:08:11.638
I was wondering where
that little squirt picked up all his moves.


01:08:11.721 --> 01:08:13.265
Too bad pops.


01:08:13.473 --> 01:08:16.101
Looks like you didn't
live up to your legend.


01:08:20.481 --> 01:08:23.818
- Come on!
- Oh no...


01:08:25.987 --> 01:08:27.489
Here, here! Told ya.
They hate this!


01:08:27.655 --> 01:08:29.699
Ay caramba.


01:08:32.327 --> 01:08:34.705
- You gotta get out of here!
- No!


01:08:35.456 --> 01:08:36.874
Keep your distance, Tiburon,


01:08:36.999 --> 01:08:39.960
or we'll chop you into ceviche!


01:08:40.044 --> 01:08:40.878
What do you think you're doing?


01:08:40.962 --> 01:08:43.172
Helping out an old friend!


01:08:43.339 --> 01:08:45.842
Like we should have done
a long time ago!


01:08:45.925 --> 01:08:47.427
Oh you bad fish, come back!


01:08:47.552 --> 01:08:49.888
Come back!
Come back right now!


01:08:50.013 --> 01:08:51.431
Let's go!


01:08:51.556 --> 01:08:53.183
Yes!


01:08:54.726 --> 01:08:57.229
Move it! Ha!
I got you now, chum!


01:08:57.896 --> 01:08:59.648
Pull him up!
Pull him up!


01:09:00.899 --> 01:09:02.192
What the?


01:09:03.444 --> 01:09:05.654
Have AT you, varlet!


01:09:07.782 --> 01:09:09.909
Thou fusty fat-kidneyed flirt-gill!


01:09:16.499 --> 01:09:18.877
I'm largely blubber!


01:09:19.044 --> 01:09:22.381
My rear end alone contains
a fatal dose of cholesterol!


01:09:23.340 --> 01:09:25.301
He SHOOTS! He SCORES!


01:09:26.552 --> 01:09:28.220
I can't move it!


01:09:28.346 --> 01:09:30.139
Perhaps we can move it together, dear.


01:09:30.223 --> 01:09:31.391
Mum!


01:09:36.980 --> 01:09:38.523
Pants, I was robbed.


01:09:38.690 --> 01:09:40.859
Ref I want instant replay.
Right now.


01:09:43.070 --> 01:09:44.405
Percy..!


01:09:49.494 --> 01:09:51.329
- The net!
- Pi... no!


01:09:51.454 --> 01:09:53.581
Don't do this, dude.


01:09:56.126 --> 01:09:57.586
It's the only way!


01:09:57.752 --> 01:10:00.005
Pi! Be careful!


01:10:00.631 --> 01:10:03.801
Troy! This is between us!


01:10:03.926 --> 01:10:06.971
Well, maybe a little squirt like you
can hide on the Reef,


01:10:07.096 --> 01:10:09.140
but we're in open water now.


01:10:09.265 --> 01:10:12.310
There's no way
you can outrun me here.


01:10:12.435 --> 01:10:14.437
Oh, yeah? We'll see about that.


01:10:30.621 --> 01:10:32.248
You're dead!


01:10:33.374 --> 01:10:35.502
What the...


01:10:35.627 --> 01:10:36.920
Got you!


01:10:37.963 --> 01:10:40.257
If I'm going,
I'm gonna take you with me.


01:10:40.340 --> 01:10:41.508
I don't think so!


01:10:58.568 --> 01:10:59.736
Help!


01:11:00.487 --> 01:11:04.825
Help, guys, please!


01:11:22.553 --> 01:11:25.055
Who's the shark who's mean and rotten,


01:11:25.181 --> 01:11:28.643
and going to be served
with potatoes au gratin?


01:11:28.809 --> 01:11:29.435
Troy!


01:11:29.560 --> 01:11:32.105
Who's gonna find himself
coated in batter,


01:11:32.230 --> 01:11:34.023
featured on a Seafood Sampler Platter?


01:11:34.149 --> 01:11:35.900
Troy!


01:11:36.026 --> 01:11:39.112
That was a fairly insane thing
you just all did.


01:11:39.780 --> 01:11:43.033
Well, you know. We thought maybe you
and the boychik could use a little help.


01:11:43.158 --> 01:11:46.829
Anything for an old amigo.


01:11:46.954 --> 01:11:51.501
Oh, Dylan! My baby.
Oh, I'm so proud!


01:11:51.668 --> 01:11:53.628
Mom, I...


01:11:55.213 --> 01:11:57.549
Excuse me.
I think you dropped this.


01:11:58.300 --> 01:12:03.847
Oh, no. That belongs to
my awesome mother.


01:12:06.350 --> 01:12:10.229
Why, thank you... Doctor.


01:12:12.607 --> 01:12:15.777
- Thank you, Nerissa.
- You can keep your thanks.


01:12:15.860 --> 01:12:18.822
And you can take this off my hands.


01:12:18.947 --> 01:12:22.034
But... This belongs to you.


01:12:22.159 --> 01:12:25.579
A long time ago, I gave it
to the girl of my dreams.


01:12:25.663 --> 01:12:27.832
We would've passed it on to our son,
if we'd had one...


01:12:27.957 --> 01:12:31.169
And if he's turned out like you.


01:12:31.294 --> 01:12:33.087
I don't know what to say.


01:12:33.213 --> 01:12:37.592
You know what to say.
I'm just not the one you need to say it to.


01:12:46.644 --> 01:12:50.648
- Cordelia...
- Oh, Pi...


01:12:52.442 --> 01:12:53.943
That sweetest thing ever!


01:12:54.068 --> 01:12:55.820
I do believe in you.


01:12:55.946 --> 01:12:57.239
Cordelia.


01:13:05.790 --> 01:13:07.625
They're kissing!


01:13:08.417 --> 01:13:11.629
- Why?
- Come on! Let's go!


01:13:50.963 --> 01:13:53.716
The townsfolk said 'Pi,
you can't possibly win!'


01:13:53.842 --> 01:13:56.970
He'll swallow your head
and pick his teeth with your fin!


01:13:57.095 --> 01:14:02.643
But Pi was determined,
he refused to despair.


01:14:03.352 --> 01:14:05.521
I know it's all true for you see...


01:14:05.729 --> 01:14:10.359
I was there!

